    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "This is a nitpick, but it doesn't make sense to me that the generated changelog for IS.js mentions Vue, especially as the relevant change in IS.js is just a \"major\" comment.\r\n\r\nI'd prefer not incrementing it, or alternatively (easier) making it a version bump only.\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n\r\n**Note:** Version bump only for package instantsearch.js\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n```",
